      "writtenOn": "2026-09-11T07:29:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "recovery of the fault detector is logged as LeakDetectedNormal, which also describes leak recovery rather than fault recovery. This can produce misleading Redfish event-log entries such as a leak “returning to normal” when only the detector fault cleared.\n\nPlease use an event ID whose message semantics match the fault state, or limit these leak events to lastLeakState.",
